<section class="section-heading">
  <h3 data-locale-text data-en="How the experiment works" data-zh="这项实验怎么做">How the experiment works</h3>
  <p data-locale-text data-en="Set the rules first, then check whether the data supports them. Each step uses information that would have been available at the time." data-zh="先固定规则，再检查数据能不能支持这套规则。每一步都尽量使用当时已经知道的信息。">Set the rules first, then check whether the data supports them. Each step uses information that would have been available at the time.</p>
</section>
<div class="research-grid">
  <article class="research-card"><span class="section-kicker" data-locale-text data-en="Step 1" data-zh="第一步">Step 1</span><h3 data-locale-text data-en="Prepare data" data-zh="准备数据">Prepare data</h3><p data-locale-text data-en="Use Tushare A-share daily prices, valuation, and adjusted prices, plus suspension and special-treatment records to audit dates without quotes. Market data currently runs through 2026-09-17." data-zh="使用 Tushare（行情数据接口）的 A 股日线、估值和复权价格。另取停牌记录与 ST（特别处理股票）记录，用来核对没有报价的日期。行情数据目前覆盖到 2026 年 9 月 17 日。">Use Tushare A-share daily prices, valuation, and adjusted prices, plus suspension and special-treatment records to audit dates without quotes. Market data currently runs through 2026-09-17.</p></article>
  <article class="research-card"><span class="section-kicker" data-locale-text data-en="Step 2" data-zh="第二步">Step 2</span><h3 data-locale-text data-en="Select securities" data-zh="选出股票">Select securities</h3><p data-locale-text data-en="After each trading-day close, rank by total market capitalization and select the 400 smallest securities. Exclude securities marked special-treatment or suspended that day, as well as invalid prices or market values." data-zh="在每个交易日收盘后，按总市值从小到大排序，选出最小的 400 只股票。剔除当日处于 ST、停牌状态，或价格、市值无效的股票。">After each trading-day close, rank by total market capitalization and select the 400 smallest securities. Exclude securities marked special-treatment or suspended that day, as well as invalid prices or market values.</p></article>
  <article class="research-card"><span class="section-kicker" data-locale-text data-en="Step 3" data-zh="第三步">Step 3</span><h3 data-locale-text data-en="Calculate returns" data-zh="计算收益">Calculate returns</h3><p data-locale-text data-en="The portfolio trades at the next trading-day close and is held until the following close. Returns are equal-weighted across 400 securities. The final observed trading day has no next session, so no return is calculated for it." data-zh="组合在下一交易日收盘时成交，再持有到下一个交易日收盘。400 只股票等权计算组合收益。最后一个有行情的交易日没有下一交易日，因此不计算它的收益。">The portfolio trades at the next trading-day close and is held until the following close. Returns are equal-weighted across 400 securities. The final observed trading day has no next session, so no return is calculated for it.</p></article>
  <article class="research-card"><span class="section-kicker" data-locale-text data-en="Step 4" data-zh="第四步">Step 4</span><h3 data-locale-text data-en="Audit missing prices" data-zh="核对缺口">Audit missing prices</h3><p data-locale-text data-en="When a selected security has no quote on the next trading day, check when quotes resume and whether suspension or special-treatment records exist in the gap. Keep gaps without direct evidence unresolved rather than treating data problems as investment outcomes." data-zh="如果选中的股票在下一交易日没有报价，就查看它之后何时恢复报价，以及这段时间是否有停牌或 ST 记录。查不到直接证据的缺口继续保留，避免把数据问题当成投资结果。">When a selected security has no quote on the next trading day, check when quotes resume and whether suspension or special-treatment records exist in the gap. Keep gaps without direct evidence unresolved rather than treating data problems as investment outcomes.</p></article>
</div>
<section class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h3 data-locale-text data-en="How to read the three return treatments" data-zh="三种收益口径怎么读">How to read the three return treatments</h3><span class="tag warm" data-locale-text data-en="Primary result and sensitivities" data-zh="主结果与敏感性">Primary result and sensitivities</span></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th data-locale-text data-en="Treatment" data-zh="口径">Treatment</th><th data-locale-text data-en="Calculation" data-zh="计算方法">Calculation</th><th data-locale-text data-en="Purpose" data-zh="用途">Purpose</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-locale-text data-en="Strict" data-zh="严格口径">Strict</td><td data-locale-text data-en="Calculate a day's return only when every selected security has a next-session price." data-zh="所有选中股票都有下一交易日价格才计算这一天的收益">Calculate a day's return only when every selected security has a next-session price.</td><td data-locale-text data-en="Primary result" data-zh="主结果">Primary result</td></tr><tr><td data-locale-text data-en="Reweight available prices" data-zh="部分股票重算">Reweight available prices</td><td data-locale-text data-en="Calculate using only securities with prices and redistribute their weights." data-zh="只用有价格的股票计算，并重新分配权重">Calculate using only securities with prices and redistribute their weights.</td><td data-locale-text data-en="Sensitivity to missing prices" data-zh="观察缺失价格对结果的上限影响">Sensitivity to missing prices</td></tr><tr><td data-locale-text data-en="Flat return for evidenced suspensions" data-zh="有证据的停牌按持平">Flat return for evidenced suspensions</td><td data-locale-text data-en="Assign zero return only to missing prices with suspension evidence; leave other gaps uncalculated." data-zh="只对有停牌记录的缺失按零收益处理，其他缺口仍不计算">Assign zero return only to missing prices with suspension evidence; leave other gaps uncalculated.</td><td data-locale-text data-en="Suspension-treatment sensitivity" data-zh="停牌处理的敏感性">Suspension-treatment sensitivity</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class="panel-note" data-locale-text data-en="The strict treatment remains the primary result. Other treatments use different sets of valid trading days, so their series must not be stitched together or used as proof of tradability." data-zh="网页上的严格口径仍是主结果。其他口径的有效交易日不同，不能直接拼成一条净值，也不能用来证明策略可以交易。">The strict treatment remains the primary result. Other treatments use different sets of valid trading days, so their series must not be stitched together or used as proof of tradability.</p></section>
<section class="panel"><div class="panel-title"><h3 data-locale-text data-en="Terms used on this page" data-zh="页面里的几个英文词">Terms used on this page</h3><span class="tag warm" data-locale-text data-en="Defined at first mention" data-zh="首次出现时说明">Defined at first mention</span></div><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th data-locale-text data-en="Term" data-zh="名称">Term</th><th data-locale-text data-en="Definition" data-zh="中文说明">Definition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>Tushare</code></td><td data-locale-text data-en="An interface providing market and other financial data." data-zh="提供行情和其他金融数据的接口">An interface providing market and other financial data.</td></tr><tr><td><code>suspend_d</code></td><td data-locale-text data-en="Daily suspension records; the internal field name is retained." data-zh="每日停牌记录，保留项目内部键值">Daily suspension records; the internal field name is retained.</td></tr><tr><td><code>stock_st</code></td><td data-locale-text data-en="Special-treatment status records; the internal field name is retained." data-zh="ST 状态记录，保留项目内部键值">Special-treatment status records; the internal field name is retained.</td></tr><tr><td>ST</td><td data-locale-text data-en="Special treatment status for a listed stock." data-zh="特别处理股票">Special treatment status for a listed stock.</td></tr><tr><td><code>PIT</code></td><td data-locale-text data-en="Point-in-time: information that was available at the time." data-zh="点时数据，也就是当时已经可以获得的信息">Point-in-time: information that was available at the time.</td></tr><tr><td><code>NAV</code></td><td data-locale-text data-en="Net asset value." data-zh="净值">Net asset value.</td></tr><tr><td><code>ETF</code></td><td data-locale-text data-en="Exchange-traded fund." data-zh="交易型开放式指数基金">Exchange-traded fund.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
